          "title": "5th Annual Downtown OIder Adults Day Outdoor Picnic",
          "description": "<p>Join the<strong> Greenwich House Independence Plaza Older Adult Center</strong> for an afternoon in the park that brings together older New Yorkers from across Lower Manhattan for lunch, community, and fun!</p>\n<p>We’ll have 200 free picnic lunches, plus dessert treats and beverages, along with free blood pressure screenings from Mount Sinai and opportunities to learn about arts, fitness, wellness programs, outings, and other resources for adults 60+.</p>\n<p><strong>Free for adults 60+. To RSVP, call Debra at (212) 267-0499 or email </strong><a href=\"mailto:dashe@greenwichhouse.org\"><strong>dashe@greenwichhouse.org</strong></a><strong>.</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-67468 alignleft\" src=\"https://greenwichhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Downtown-Older-Adult-Picnic.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https://greenwichhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Downtown-Older-Adult-Picnic.jpg 640w, https://greenwichhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Downtown-Older-Adult-Picnic-200x133.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></p>",
